...@../../_tools/theme
shape: sequence_diagram

user: 사용자 { class: person }
ui: Streamlit UI { class: ours }
pipeline: RAGPipeline { class: ours }
ragie: Ragie API { class: ext }
claude: Claude API { class: ext }

user -> ui: 질문 입력
ui -> pipeline: process_query(query)
pipeline -> ragie: POST /retrievals
ragie -> pipeline: scored_chunks (청크 텍스트)
pipeline -> claude: messages.create (프롬프트+질문)
claude -> pipeline: 답변 텍스트
pipeline -> ui: 답변 문자열
ui -> user: 화면 표시
